Near-miss for diag.redeclare_is_noop: the same name in two procedures, and
a procedure reusing a script-level name (procedure scopes start empty).
Repeated assignments are not declarations.
-- input.ssl --
:DECLARE nCounter;
nCounter := 1;
nCounter := 2;
:PROCEDURE First;
	:DECLARE nCounter;
	nCounter := 3;
	:RETURN nCounter;
:ENDPROC;
:PROCEDURE Second;
	:DECLARE nCounter;
	nCounter := 4;
	:RETURN nCounter;
:ENDPROC;
-- format --
:DECLARE nCounter;
nCounter := 1;
nCounter := 2;
:PROCEDURE First;
	:DECLARE nCounter;
	nCounter := 3;
	:RETURN nCounter;
:ENDPROC;

:PROCEDURE Second;
	:DECLARE nCounter;
	nCounter := 4;
	:RETURN nCounter;
:ENDPROC;
-- diagnostics --
-- diagnostics [--strict --info] --
